      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Muhammad Bin Yahya, from Ahmad Bin Muhammad, from Ibn Fazzal, from one of our companions, ",
          "(It has been narrated) from Abu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup> having said: ‘Do not pray <span class=\"iTxt\">Salāt</span> in the valley of Al-Shaqrat’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "11. Muhammad ibn Yahya has narrated from Ahmad ibn Muhammad from ibn Faddal from certain persons of our people who have said the following: “Abu ‘Abd Allah, ‘Alayhi al-Salam, has said, ‘Salah (prayer) is not performed in al-Shuqrah valley.’” "
        ]
      }
